; Split-horizon zone for n8n.peetvandesande.com.
;
; Publicly a CNAME to ruby, which reverse-proxies webhooks (and, for home and
; VPN ranges only, the editor) to moby over wgclient1 - homelab/moby/ruby.
; Inside the lab it resolves to moby, whose nginx fronts the n8n stack with a
; lab-CA certificate carrying this name. n8n knows itself by this one URL
; (WEBHOOK_URL), so the same webhook works from both sides.
;
; The zone is deliberately the SINGLE NAME, not peetvandesande.com, and needs a
; matching addNTA() on Delphi or every lookup here SERVFAILs.
;
; GENERATED by dns/ansible - do not edit this file by hand.
; The source is dns/ansible/group_vars/all.yml. Change it there and run
;   cd dns/ansible && ansible-playbook zones.yml
; which rewrites this file, bumps the serial only if the contents changed,
; pushes it to Pythia and reloads just this zone.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN n8n.peetvandesande.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026102801  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.8.27             ; moby
@       IN  AAAA    fd33:5692:1834:1000:be24:11ff:fe13:54b8 ; moby's ULA
